      "answer": "Here is the *Brittle* condition in Frosthaven:\n\n---\n\n**Brittle** (Negative Condition) — *Rulebook, passage 100*\n\n> The next time the figure would suffer damage from any source, they instead suffer double that amount of damage, and Brittle is then removed. Brittle is also removed if the figure is healed.\n\n---\n\n**Key interactions:**\n\n- **Ward cancels Brittle:** If a figure has both *Ward* and *Brittle* when it suffers damage, the two conditions **negate each other and are both removed** — neither the doubling nor the halving applies.\n- **Healing removes it early:** Any *Heal* effect on the figure removes *Brittle* before it triggers on the next hit.\n- **Single-hit trigger:** *Brittle* is consumed by the **first** instance of damage the figure takes, not each attack in a turn.",
